# HYPOTHESIS ONLY. Never accepted by load.sh; parser/runtime NOT verified.
# Render the placeholders with renderer.py. No shell expansion/macros/includes.
# A separate translation call + filter call must be reviewed/delegated by user.
# Order: translation section before filter section (pf.conf grammar).
rdr on lo0 inet proto tcp from any to @TARGET_V4@ port @TARGET_PORT@ tagged @TAG@ -> 127.0.0.1 port @GATEWAY_PORT@
# Limit the experiment to one synthetic target/port, not arbitrary Internet traffic.
# The tag belongs to the outbound socket UID. Whether it survives lo0 is NET-08.
pass out quick route-to (lo0 127.0.0.1) inet proto tcp from any to @TARGET_V4@ port @TARGET_PORT@ user @UID@ tag @TAG@ keep state
# Observe whether translated re-entry needs this branch, and its attribution.
pass in quick on lo0 inet proto tcp from any to 127.0.0.1 port @GATEWAY_PORT@ tagged @TAG@ keep state
block drop out quick inet proto tcp from any to any user @UID@
block drop out quick inet proto udp from any to any user @UID@
block drop out quick inet6 proto tcp from any to any user @UID@
block drop out quick inet6 proto udp from any to any user @UID@
# NO inference about ingress, ICMP, system service traffic or PF-loss protection.
# Direct access to GATEWAY_PORT by other UIDs must be rejected by authenticated
# gateway/helper policy; this template supplies no such authentication.
